	<text xml:lang="la">
		<body>
			<div>
				<p>
					<s n="1" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z1"/>Salus in domino.</s>
					<s n="2" xml:lang="la">Distribui libellos omnibus, ad quos misisti, excepto d. <lb xml:id="p1z2"/><persName ref="p2916">Schertlino</persName>, cui brevi mittam, quum ad nos miserit nuntium, quemadmodum promisit, <lb xml:id="p1z3"/>quem spero me in <placeName ref="l632">Alsatia</placeName> visurum brevi.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="3" xml:lang="la" ana="salute">Nova: <lb xml:id="p1z4"/><persName>Mauritianus</persName> exercitus reliquit <placeName ref="l157">Francofordiam</placeName> accepta ingenti pecuniae <lb xml:id="p1z5"/>summa, bombardis et aliis ad bellicam rem adtinentibus rebus; petit <lb xml:id="p1z6"/><placeName>Oschenburgum</placeName> episcopale oppidum, dein <placeName ref="l1030">Wirtzburgensem</placeName> episcopum salutab<lb xml:id="p1z7"/>it pro viatico et commeatu.</s>
					<s n="4" xml:lang="la">Aiunt, quod mirabile apud me, <persName ref="p8282">Maxi<lb xml:id="p1z8"/>milianum</persName>, filium regis <persName ref="p18477">Ferdinandi</persName>, apud <persName>Mauritianum</persName> exercitum esse accepto <lb xml:id="p1z9"/>salvo conductu, et quid instituat quidve quęrat, dubito.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="5" xml:lang="la">Quid si <lb xml:id="p1z10"/>imitari conaretur <persName>S. Tarquinii</persName> factum, qui Gabios mira arte devi<lb xml:id="p1z11"/>cit elusitque?</s>
					<s n="6" xml:lang="la"><persName>Caesar</persName> qua arte <placeName ref="l18">Augustam</placeName> recuperaverit post triste bellum, <lb xml:id="p1z12"/>norunt omnes.</s>
					<s n="7" xml:lang="la">Aut simultates sunt apud fratres ob imperiale fastigium, <lb xml:id="p1z13"/>aut dolo malo omnia aguntur.</s>
					<s n="8" xml:lang="la">Principes oculos aperiant et prudenter <lb xml:id="p1z14"/>in tam arduo negotio agant.</s>
					<s n="9" xml:lang="la">Lantgravii filius et princeps de <placeName ref="l701">Mechelburg</placeName> <lb xml:id="p1z15"/>abducti sunt in <placeName ref="l832">Galliam</placeName>; obsides erunt, donec bellum istud crudel<lb xml:id="p1z16"/>e fuerit finitum.</s>
					<s n="10" xml:lang="la">Expectant <placeName ref="l749">Saxonici</placeName> nobiles adhuc quosdam principes <lb xml:id="p1z17"/>in singulas horas adventuros.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="11" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z18"/>D. <persName ref="p2916">Schertlino</persName> omnia prospere succedunt; in <placeName ref="l691">Lotharingia</placeName> <lb xml:id="p1z19"/>castrametatus est in cęnobio monialium <placeName>Rimlisperg</placeName> expectans <lb xml:id="p1z20"/>regium exercitum.</s>
					<s n="12" xml:lang="la"><placeName ref="l491">Argentina</placeName> in magno periculo est; pfaffi mussitant <lb xml:id="p1z21"/>nescio [quid]; <placeName ref="l922">Friburgum</placeName> sese conferunt, in quo oppido debet perire absque <lb xml:id="p1z22"/>dubio deo ita disponente sentina illa omnium malorum.</s>
					<s n="13" xml:lang="la">In <placeName ref="l808">Belgis</placeName> magnus <lb xml:id="p1z23"/>est collectus exercitus; nobilis <persName ref="p7364">Martinus de Rossen</persName> habet pedites <lb xml:id="p1z24"/>et equites, cui adhęret regina, qui tentatus est semel ad Cęsarem <lb xml:id="p1z25"/>ire, sed impeditus est ab Hessis et a domino ab Heideck.</s>
					<s n="14" xml:lang="la">De Anglo <lb xml:id="p1z26"/>nihil audimus nec de <persName ref="p3671">Dano</persName>, qui reges ingentem collegerunt exercitum; <lb xml:id="p1z27"/>sed nescitur, quid velint instituere aut contra quem moturi.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="15" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z28"/><persName>Ferdinandici</persName> colligunt passim in pagis rusticos; signa aliquot miserunt <lb xml:id="p1z29"/>in <placeName>Vallem</placeName>, vulgo <foreign xml:lang="de">das <placeName>Wilertal</placeName>, welches abkoufft hat dem adel der von <lb xml:id="p1z30"/><placeName>Bolwil</placeName> zuͦ <placeName ref="l257">Costentz</placeName>.</foreign></s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="16" xml:lang="la">Volunt impedire exercitum regium ne <placeName ref="l491">Argentinam</placeName> <lb xml:id="p1z31"/>defendat; sed miseri frustra arma sumunt; credunt esse hostes, cum <lb xml:id="p1z32"/>non sint lacessiti ab illo, nec intelligunt belli huius fontem.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="17" xml:lang="la">Petit <pb/><lb xml:id="p2z1"/>rex in <placeName ref="l691">Lotharingia</placeName> tres civitates olim imperiales, misit ad illas cadu<lb xml:id="p2z2"/>ceatorem, ut nomen dent imperio Romano; an id velint facere, ignoro.</s>
					<s n="18" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p2z3"/>Petit praeterea ab istis civitatibus commeatum, obsides et pecuniam in sumptus <lb xml:id="p2z4"/>bellicos.</s>
					<s n="19" xml:lang="la">Caesar minatur principibus et civitatibus extrema quęque, <lb xml:id="p2z5"/>si ab illo defecerint.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="20" xml:lang="de"><lb xml:id="p2z6"/>Das gantzs Bistum <placeName ref="l307">Mentz</placeName> und <placeName ref="l471">Speir</placeName> ist ingenomen, ußgnon <placeName ref="l471">Speir</placeName> <lb xml:id="p2z7"/>und <placeName ref="l307">Mentzs</placeName> die stett; die beid bischöff sindt zuͦ <placeName ref="l210">Heidelberg</placeName> gsin, haben <lb xml:id="p2z8"/>raths gefragt, wie si sich sollen halten, der pfaltzgraff geantwort, er kynne inen <lb xml:id="p2z9"/>jetz nit rathen; sy sollen luͦgen, wo es hinuß welle.</s>
					<s n="21" xml:lang="de">Synd also heimkert, <lb xml:id="p2z10"/>haben etlich pfaltzgrevisch ritter begert, die inen geben; do ist uff sy ein huff <lb xml:id="p2z11"/>gezogen, das sy schier weren gefangen worden.</s>
					<s n="22" xml:lang="de">Handt wider zuͦruck kert, <lb xml:id="p2z12"/>hernach ein schiff lassen bereitten, uff dem Necker gon <placeName ref="l471">Spier</placeName> gefaren.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="23" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p2z13"/>Episcopus <placeName ref="l569">Vormaciensis</placeName> mortuus est iis diebus et alius mox in illius locum suffectus; <lb xml:id="p2z14"/>aiunt esse bonum virum.</s>
					<s n="24" xml:lang="la">Pfaffi <placeName ref="l471">Spirenses</placeName> et <placeName ref="l307">Moguntini</placeName> absconderunt se, quidam <placeName ref="l267">Co<lb xml:id="p2z15"/>loniam Agrippinam</placeName> migrarunt, quidam ad nobiles fugierunt latibula tuta quaerentes.</s>
					<s n="25" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p2z16"/>Quid putas actum esse <placeName ref="l18">Augustę</placeName> cum pfaffis interimisticis?</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="26" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p2z17"/>Curavi libellum ad me missum <placeName ref="l832">Gallicum</placeName> diligentissime; unum accepit dominus <lb xml:id="p2z18"/><persName ref="p6328">Conradius Roescius</persName>; <foreign xml:lang="de">dann es wolt sich nit schicken bede dem postmeyster ze geben,</foreign> qui <lb xml:id="p2z19"/>alias erat, onustiorem sarcinam habebat, quam soleret.</s>
					<s n="27" xml:lang="la">Nec puto te repugnaturum.</s>
					<s n="28" xml:lang="la">Die 13. indicem <lb xml:id="p2z20"/>librorum aprilis accipiet libellum.</s>
					<s n="29" xml:lang="la" ana="farewell">Vale in domino.</s>
					<s n="30" xml:lang="la">Nonne prolixus fui?</s>
					<s n="31" xml:lang="la">Indicem librorum communicabit <lb xml:id="p2z21"/><persName ref="p8171">Theodorus</persName> noster, si petis.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="32" xml:lang="la">T[uus] <persName ref="p1278">Gastius</persName> ex animo.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="33" xml:lang="la">Domino <persName ref="p495">Heinrycho Bullinger<lb xml:id="p2z22"/>o</persName>, ecclesiae <placeName ref="l587">Tigurinae</placeName> pastori fide<lb xml:id="p2z23"/>lissimo, domino suo perpetuo colendo.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="34" xml:lang="la"><placeName ref="l231">Ingolsta<lb xml:id="p2z24"/>dium</placeName> se dedit; <placeName ref="l513">Ulmam</placeName> vexare <lb xml:id="p2z25"/>conantur.</s>
					<s n="35" xml:lang="la"><persName>Hessus</persName> cum <persName ref="p18250">Mauritio</persName> <placeName ref="l808">Belgas</placeName> petunt.</s>
					<s n="36" xml:lang="la">Rex Gall.<lb xml:id="p2z26"/>.. post quatuor et quinque dies <lb xml:id="p2z27"/>occupabit <placeName ref="l2459">Rhenum</placeName>.</s>
				</p>
			</div>
		</body>
	</text>
</TEI>